### Sample constraint

set_false_path -from [get_ports rstn_i]
set_false_path -from [get_clocks {osc0_inst_hf_clk_out*}] -to [get_clocks {pll0_inst_clkop*}]
set_false_path -from [get_clocks {pll0_inst_clkop*}] -to [get_clocks {osc0_inst_hf_clk_out*}]
